# Performance Rule

Apply this rule for rendering, data fetching, animation, and bundle-impacting changes.

## Core Web Vitals Focus

- LCP: prioritize critical content rendering; reduce render-blocking work.
- INP: avoid long main-thread tasks and heavy sync event handlers.
- CLS: reserve layout space and avoid unexpected shifts.

## Frontend Practices

- Limit unnecessary rerenders and expensive derived computations.
- Keep animation performant (transform/opacity preferred).
- Avoid oversized dependencies and accidental bundle growth.
- Use lazy loading and code-splitting where appropriate.

## Investigation Output

When asked for perf diagnosis, include:

- observed bottleneck
- user impact
- prioritized fix options
